      "title": {
        "en": "Exceptional warmth from clinical team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners express unanimous appreciation for the veterinary team at Roehampton, highlighting Dr Miren Singh, Dr Georgie, and front desk staff Lesley and Glenn. Clients consistently praise the surgery's warm, supportive atmosphere and unhurried approach, noting that staff consistently go beyond expectations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 23,
      "title": {
        "en": "Loving attention and stress reduction"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients describe a reassuring environment where dogs and cats are treated with genuine affection and gentle care. Reviewers emphasize that staff comfort nervous pets in the waiting area with cuddles and treats, ensuring that even timid rescue animals feel secure during routine examinations."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective treatments and emergency response"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Recent reviews reflect strong satisfaction with medical outcomes, ranging from prompt emergency appointments to successful treatments for complex dermatitis and senior pet conditions. Owners appreciate thorough diagnostic investigations and clear post-treatment care plans."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How quickly are emergency situations seen at Medivet Roehampton?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Clients report receiving emergency consultation slots within thirty minutes of calling during acute pet health concerns."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Where are out-of-hours emergencies redirected?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Outside normal surgery hours, emergency cases are transferred to Medivet 24 Hour Richmond for hospital care."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is parking accessible at the Roehampton practice?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, dedicated parking is available directly outside the practice building adjacent to Putney Heath."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are clinicians experienced with nervous rescue pets?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet parents frequently note that clinicians and reception staff use gentle handling, cuddles, and treats to ease nervous rescue animals."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
